  <media:group>
   <media:title>Introducing Tesla Self-Driving V15</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/eNBqkc7V1nU?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i2.ytimg.com/vi/eNBqkc7V1nU/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>FSD V15 now starting to roll out – upgrading every part of the end-to-end driving network 

Safety:
25x better handling of safety critical cases

Tesla Reality View:
New real-time generative driving visualization that continuously streams a view from an arbitrary virtual camera situated above your vehicle, enabling you to see and control what FSD is planning to do.

Select between fullscreen visualizations, maps or a split view - or choose quiet mode for a calming cabin experience.

Upcoming navigation turns display directly in the driving visualization.

Turn signals are quieter and fade out after a few clicks.

Navigation:
Navigation for start &amp; end of the trip now learns end-to-end from fleet route preferences. Later v15 releases will expand this to the entire route.

Improved Detection:
You also should notice better detection of signs, animals, debris, potholes and standing water, plus more natural speed handling in school zones and inclement weather.

Lastly, FSD can now slow for speed cameras &amp; Bike Rack Mode lets you enable FSD w/ bike racks or similar hitch accessories

Design your vehicle – https://www.tesla.com/</media:description>
